##  Generated WireGuard key pairs for simulated Server A and Server B

> **Timestamp:** `2026-07-07 15:47:57`

### 01. `sudo bash -c 'cd /etc/wireguard && umask 077 && wg genkey | tee server_a_private.key | wg pubkey | tee server_a_public.key && wg genkey | tee server_b_private.key | wg pubkey | tee server_b_public.key'`

```bash
sudo bash -c 'cd /etc/wireguard && umask 077 && wg genkey | tee server_a_private.key | wg pubkey | tee server_a_public.key && wg genkey | tee server_b_private.key | wg pubkey | tee server_b_public.key'
```

**Output:**

```text
P5o0FI7PRLEn85QRyEkvyuEA2OynsRmFnOSlxaIETyc=
SBP5UQqyLWTyPWPYQG/vhmo6+3kghPOlV9KCl+dYp1E=
```


